...@../../../dev/d2/themes/state
vars: { d2-config: { layout-engine: tala;  pad: 80 } }
title: TERMINAL RESOURCE OWNER / ORIGINAL OBLIGATION {
  shape: text
  near: top-center
  style.font-size: 36
  style.bold: true
}
original: Scheme semantics / Go ingress\nOriginal claim and authority vector\nReservation / history / unknown exposure {
  class: card
  icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/go.svg
  icon.near: top-left
  left: 0
  top: 0
  width: 550
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#eef3ef"
}
active: CPU-budgeted exclusive writer lease\nFresh transaction / current authority\nCancellation does not imply rollback {
  class: card
  left: 810
  top: 0
  width: 550
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#e7edf4"
}
unknown: Commit outcome reconciliation\nDriver Unknown discards session\nKnown commit / lost reply stays recorded {
  class: card
  left: 1620
  top: 0
  width: 550
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#f4f2ec"
}
stopped: Closing is terminal\nDeny checkout / refuse live-lease close\nDiscard late returns / no resurrection {
  class: card
  left: 0
  top: 620
  width: 550
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#f4f2ec"
}
recovery: Fresh provider / original database\nRecover original operation and authority\nKeep unknown obligation held {
  class: card
  left: 810
  top: 620
  width: 550
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#e7edf4"
}
executor: Rust final transport owner\nCurrent Policy / history / owner fence\nOne-use admission at actual release {
  class: card
  icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/rust.svg
  icon.near: top-left
  left: 1620
  top: 620
  width: 550
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#eef3ef"
}
original -> active: Same canonical binding { style.font-size: 20 }
active -> unknown: Native transaction result { style.font-size: 20 }
active -> stopped: Begin close / drain accepted work { style.font-size: 20 }
stopped -> recovery: Complete resource closure { style.font-size: 20 }
unknown -> recovery: Exact durable reconciliation { style.font-size: 20 }
recovery -> executor: Separate current-use admission { style.font-size: 20 }
footer: "Resource closure is not authority revocation · A free slot is not refunded budget\nHistorical replay never recreates a live send capability" {
  shape: text
  left: 140
  top: 1080
  width: 1890
  height: 120
  style.font-size: 28
  style.font-color: "#5c8b77"
}

